&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/holophonix-animator-blender" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/dewiweb/holophonix-animator-blender?style=flat-square&amp;logo=github&amp;color=6366f1&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="GitHub stars" />
&lt;/a>
