&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/holophonix-animator-blender" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dépôt GitHub&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Langage : Python&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>openagenda-slides</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/openagenda-slides/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/openagenda-slides/</guid><description>
